OL,3,APressure grows on Trump's Commerce
OL,4,ASecretary Lutnick in fallout from
OL,5,ANvidia scandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent has
OL,8,Fblamed Howard Lutnick's Commerce
OL,9,FDepartment for failing to properly
OL,10,Foversee the export of high-spec AI
OL,11,Fchips, as the fallout from the Nvidia
OL,12,Fscandal widens to President Donald
OL,13,FTrump's cabinet.
OL,15,FPressure is building on Lutnick from
OL,16,Facross the political spectrum to
OL,17,Fexplain his department's actions.
OL,19,FJensen Huang was ousted as Nvidia CEO
OL,20,Fafter revelations he had an affair with
OL,21,Fa businesswoman who was also allegedly
OL,22,Fa Chinese spy.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
