OL,3,APolice investigating David Walliams
OL,4,Aover reports alleging serious sexual
OL,5,Aoffences
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Metropolitan Police has launched an
OL,8,Finvestigation into David Walliams over
OL,9,Freports of "alleged serious sexual
OL,10,Foffences".
OL,12,FIt comes after ITV News and the
OL,13,FGuardian published reports alleging
OL,14,Fthat Walliams had been accused of
OL,15,Fsexual misconduct by several women.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
